{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30018_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:36964ddeeae6664f30d04b2d7849c96f3b2837fa44bf72b5108b5b18addda033",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0088d250d000b74e5b3b4420b1c210331a70507e9fbd604a8f84dc8e9901d1d2",
      "text": "正因是我们，才做得到的事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41dc883762d03e93eaa3a0d3efa7a76487e1d4a5d4e5e17684091f85ead7707a",
      "text": "收到清凉饮料水广告邀约，干劲十足的\nJupiter。配合“为恋爱加油打气的饮品”\n这一主题，3人分别扮演各自的\n设定角色。广告带来的良好反响，\n甚至还拓展出了其他的工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0088d250d000b74e5b3b4420b1c210331a70507e9fbd604a8f84dc8e9901d1d2",
      "text": "正因是我们，才做得到的事",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a1988ecb16799445adfd4562fd462e5ca555094b5cddebd81e688971e8e9520",
      "text": "Ciao☆ ●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:733dffc44f39b622e8dff33a00efb1a620baefb4cb539e9d55d8b5043921e543",
      "text": "各位辛苦了！\n今天的碰头开会，就请多多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc94864901670ce74daac13855d47b6faf132e194b5c58d7434e6606a8b27a0b",
      "text": "嗯！……啊，●●●●プロデューサー，\n我可以喝这瓶饮料吗？我口渴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad2fd45ba82d6d10b46dbe1dd0c6e432b4602bf788d92529b3ef5bb1854b6ff4",
      "text": "嗯，可以的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e17403adbe5be4fc529134dcf925e7bd16125506f38d4cec89c3c0423d7cb38",
      "text": "太好啦，那我就开动啦♪\n……哈啊。真好喝啊，这个！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:800218a758e20ebe9915bc1525881521cfe13b06d6e92bdcc5c267954c8a58b8",
      "text": "太好了！其实这次，我们收到了这款\n清凉饮料水的广告拍摄邀约。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d039ed41db782260fb5982a42819f1dc2cb0ec1fdf760cdaf4192fd9083d920",
      "text": "嘿，广告的邀约啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f9b1103084831323aa5a5eb30e293e87d6f3d9ecdc098a1617e730ce1df2579",
      "text": "是的。听说广告的主题是\n“为恋爱加油打气的饮品”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71849493a930a582af8eb0333913eb56739105c0190cae38479b3776e64b494d",
      "text": "对方希望各位能扮演为受恋爱困扰的年轻人\n温柔提供建议的恋爱顾问角色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92b3a8913359f4e9d086513d5f70c8c289e93b4ed6c90223465cd7540ee5e70d",
      "text": "哎。很棒的主题呢。\n那种事情是我的拿手好戏哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2622ce2b383ce122c74014bf50718e0e50c5b7528d98b42a7c7253d997dc996",
      "text": "我们在工作上也积累了各种各样的经验嘛！\n这份邀约，务必让我们接下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70822dbcc1ce3a03401044c41d4bd51f4db941908165afdf199ac1974ff3e902",
      "text": "冬马君暂且不提，\n有比你们两个更受欢迎的我在，绝对能成功的呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45811beccc273d6c4da57b58ab769721db3bc6da2cba40e3eed994b2268a89ad",
      "text": "上课当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d293b210919b85aebd2890167eb88a2c56374936923c38ea0937df86c7d28d8",
      "text": "北斗，你看得出我的表演还有什么不足之处吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74362d0f87e99c7519565412be7193959cbda8d310662b5bae9f940392a9bf88",
      "text": "啊，我也想要建议！稍微看我一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:552ad0b224854e5c8519dfe98dbfedf82898f3e029310e617a0413f6d4117195",
      "text": "“鼓起勇气，试着去跟对方搭话吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8002e65f13c63ecf3080f1c33eaab76c3b272b7529a5c95bc246b2a42933b838",
      "text": "这个嘛……首先冬马你，\n会不会稍微有点太用力了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dccbe2249261020ae1f85598c31caf5c569398929c8a570594f6a4d3dcba9268",
      "text": "如果给建议的人太僵硬的话，对方也会跟着紧张的\n嘛。试着以在背后推对方一把的感觉来演怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a150b7a200beb9a3509c552672d867aa2271ab91bb00fec1ec8d3b921ccfb573",
      "text": "太用力……也就是说，要放松肩膀的力道啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80e7968f3d41b1a8951a2b129c9a08ffd6350bf26dc1f627f5a9771cc48fda7d",
      "text": "翔太的话，或许更注重自然的状态会比较好哦。\n比起刻意去演，那样反而更能打动对方的心灵哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edb9e80a04d717407dd7b00ef3c9987af85688ee66f1fdec2e2f37ec15753ac8",
      "text": "刚才光想着必须好好演，不知不觉就浑身紧绷了。\n不愧是北斗君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b5ad4251ffa68abd7871cbb1d92a4c47af7358aa38b554d79e7a83cb7b59bd8",
      "text": "呵呵，毕竟彼此交往的时间也不短了嘛。\n那么，再试一次看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000152:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22",
      "text": "课程结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdb9752a98226e2951fbe7a34dfdf6f48e5ef7d45c4b00a2f3561cf156a41ace",
      "text": "恋爱顾问啊～……\n总觉得北斗君跟恋爱烦恼完全无缘呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74c313948353b7227c56e0222ce2b06cf98208a122cbce6f6e0eb8385ae9631d",
      "text": "没那回事哦。\n我也和大家一样，常常有很多烦恼呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_b:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b25aceebd7af540167060aed80c9e75028af885713102e875799708444d929ce",
      "text": "嘴上这么说，但不管遇到什么事总是游刃有余\n的样子，才最像北斗嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_c:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22abf24e5f63a81298f344c6745c30078ac1573401a3f458299af68cbbea364c",
      "text": "广告正式拍摄……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ce455eff59dcddff372388ff0f578d6d0cdb6d62b025e538c7a90e13ee2d8a3",
      "text": "“别担心。换作是你一定没问题的！\n鼓起勇气，试着去跟对方搭话看看吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb2ce294faa7fb615afcbb2eceed8e40f3bbfc225d05eaa52e63ee5db72d93b1",
      "text": "“不把心意传达出去的话，就什么都无法开始。\n只要老老实实把自己的想法说出来就行了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0332be1c8522fd6f08e9c92d2fb3d6de33810e4a7603686bd6b89b5405d81112",
      "text": "“不要对自己的真心说谎。\n带着自信，去表达这份心意吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92ac71fae5cc55e5cb096a5bb30a2e5333b6021e2d06741ab51a68a4f9d136e4",
      "text": "“润泽心灵。让你的恋爱，加速前行”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_c:cmd-000109:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78",
      "text": "休息中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a513b706fadb6b16a6461fa128c6bdd750de09d14ad7e208a4f085c12215e6dd",
      "text": "各位，辛苦了。\n拍摄进行得非常顺利呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_c:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8d5f62cee02844be100a60327a0da5cbe5718ddadbcd7c9c2a203a14fb38954",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！\n这也是多亏了北斗君的建议吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_c:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c447fc3801b7f479609e46451c6a109ca3228101df61cd4bc46ffec7707641f",
      "text": "是啊。\n就保持这股势头，一口气拍到最后吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_c:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d71c46e10699a7a3f2d53694ab60b952623866a599bf3c570df2718d6f5d1b",
      "text": "那太好啦！接下来要检查成片，\n我们去导演先生那里吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31598760f156dfd72348293759dd66e2bc0d644f3b5365c84b377b260f1588f8",
      "text": "……非常棒呢！不仅凝聚了各位全新的魅力，\n整个画面也呈现得极为精彩！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:993aef6cfb0fb3354ba3fb89021394395c2c0989e35747756d0b43c56cf1ff72",
      "text": "谢谢！\n为别人的恋爱加油打气，试过之后感觉挺有意思的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb65a9257167563ac7cb3b671d2a865e406b623cd71eb167300567e1861b5cd5",
      "text": "而且贴心密友这个设定也很新鲜有趣！\n工作人员们也都夸奖说配合得天衣无缝哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75037964e7207e59c92d341360abd153108dcb1d0a27d7e30ce773bd47d5c545",
      "text": "是啊。冬马先生和北斗先生也展现出了和平时\n不同的一面，我想粉丝们一定会非常高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d8648faad7caf64452e3c0beae34adea26049849ac40c5ef691adfb6c1d7018",
      "text": "我的角色是温柔的大哥嘛。要露出让人\n觉得可靠的笑容，还是稍微有点难度的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:653c8afa87bb0b070596ce5c2929cb6daa5fef28632116cacf294d345e13ba40",
      "text": "在这一点上，北斗表现得很到位啊。\n看起来比平时还要帅气干练得多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7a428882d5b772b63444ff2d134033f3685dc2937e5f325ff17d05c0f84cf8a",
      "text": "是啊。毕竟是认真负责的哥哥角色嘛，\n所以在表演时有特意留心这方面吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0fa7ab33f91ba888115493ac5f779e4cd57bf3cc966e1e9d78c3bfea76aebfd",
      "text": "不过也多亏了这样，感觉展现出了全新的魅力……\n要是天使酱们能够高兴的话就太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f86149c8d76fcf91b29d4237d5d09e0926e9fa7322ad26821dad0b991f46b5ae",
      "text": "真是游刃有余啊……可恶，我可不能输。\n让我再拍一次吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a454fec9222bbaf390685edfbad1b53b6e1c3ac942680fd94a4f53761d035c28",
      "text": "啊，我也是！刚才拍的那个镜头里，\n我有觉得在意的地方！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e34724ce7e1e884a27f512190265bf099a2d75bce3a4c5eace43d61f611e9031",
      "text": "北斗先生这边没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42b24a60a682768db6b82d72cf29a3b928f723ff85e457de4d6f6770189ce34",
      "text": "没问题。刚才那一版我已经倾尽全力了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:537508e9970a14887ab4953a46bd7f891557bcf8c6961a5dcd4b4fa995cd8ef1",
      "text": "原来如此。即使面对不习惯的角色也能\n稳妥地应对自如……真不愧是北斗先生呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64fcf2c2c4d402a3f905ae9a9bc949ec0542d64161543f4487d4934df197067d",
      "text": "呵呵，只要一想到天使酱，\n就不是什么难事哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000125:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "几周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000139:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd791c5a9a8530dd9b8dfc8c73dc496f66daf9a67a7748e0d37d12d91737ade1",
      "text": "喂喂，制作人。\n广告已经开始播出了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000141:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:748a8132dd1517678cc29a3c9850614a77f7a1975a0bb19b850f8b835534defe",
      "text": "刚才看电视的时候正好播到了哦。\n全家人一起看的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000143:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6180b780ffc522e5ae377d5dcebfaf99bfc77fb4bed4d4de8e509b5c20963d01",
      "text": "然后啊，你听我说哦。姐姐们\n好像超级喜欢那个广告，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000145:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1275bbe22bc1db215e10b14eb052fe9afc5925bb2306a023907d2140b88f77c",
      "text": "甚至还说什么“这个广告也\n必须要录下来”呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000147:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44c983ad2c17eeaa5774a1f7e9ea721fe8c02fa17297b2b094fb962caeac3445",
      "text": "因为成片确实是\n一支非常棒的广告呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000150:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0046e993877f99b3ca2826d15bdf9e4ff9c11a6e54f3a168348e3e1e11609e2a",
      "text": "嘿嘿，说得也是呢！\n嘛，姐姐们的反应向来是那样，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000152:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:177d06163f59f1441164f1eb2ba57020de001356771d249aa3fd070610a1c4b0",
      "text": "虽然总觉得现在才来夸也有点……\n不过嘛，被人夸奖总归心情不坏呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000154:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22fc8a1ee9ed7611dedf0cc1ad1b8ab86c5e1e222759933c05b86721b01e5972",
      "text": "而且这次的工作，\n感觉很新鲜，超级开心的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000156:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da4551815d810abd94ae7649f84a10c3609f03eff97bc9e4a8c52f5c77fb7892",
      "text": "冬马君他们也展现出了跟平时\n稍微有点不同的感觉，光看着就很有趣哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_d:cmd-000158:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3f44a5807d151c35c08114550433ae83fbd71255781adcdf61d458a4b1660ab",
      "text": "那么制作人，\n谢谢你听我聊了这么多哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0502268938cc7617094022ac19f695794b4154e3afcb0abc9572b58299f1893c",
      "text": "广播电台的嘉宾出演？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed2156417ee4c229488cc52041780135d3a6b21269f943bae0a24b00133387e2",
      "text": "是的！因为广告的反响非常好，\n对方务必想邀请各位出演。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29074d7f0608ce63cae58352bdb2d6fe2f38575504e2912a31b75e5138398a6a",
      "text": "听说是由前阵子拍摄广告的商品厂商赞助的\n节目，主要是通过那层关系促成的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:768e5f95148a02839d5f03c5d05fc641606937a5c30914597b6d776706287294",
      "text": "嘿～……还有解答听众来信咨询的\n问答环节啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d74962cc11c441a657b585c4ac30d2936b43842d1c610d7012de54ce72ae344",
      "text": "这次是要真正去给出恋爱建议呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f85f5417ea7befd53ede42b89290178c1215d820eaea44646b5da469377c83e",
      "text": "是的。而且是连续两周的安排。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c40b1a9060d635d71b8ec195b2dcdf5e71942fa1c845e210329aacdcabb1c1",
      "text": "连续两周吗。那说明我们很受期待嘛！\n交给我们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2428f666411db8f4786e58c0a9009a13f77328090054c14f3969aa0a6223142",
      "text": "是啊。看了那个广告之后萌生出想找我们\n商量的想法，真的让人很高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:829c77e62eda825b47c52cac61b6ed1bcd95ecae94ab7e45889f8bb894f3a65b",
      "text": "为了那些在恋爱中烦恼的天使酱们，\n这份邀约，请务必让我们接下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b578e324468235fbe4051090c5580d0eb07601770bc21fc1acb94d8ea9a21655",
      "text": "早上好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09659eff3eceed65968ea8fa8abb59e08a18bc0ce5e2f0ddcac7a098cee7073d",
      "text": "Jupiter的各位，早上好！\n今天一整天，请多多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8db5a8ff54e0de8244df2f4ffca6c8ce9fe520146371b7c61a1b063e07f067eb",
      "text": "哎呀，来了啊。哎呀～\nJupiter能来参加，真是太让人高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56bf5896bce30fcd04122c925539b25d072bd70d098919dfc2587ffb1d64b83b",
      "text": "我们这边才要感谢您给我们这么宝贵的机会！\n今天请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e030a1b31f1c7c4e951e5feecf01b818af019ba167f19f39120d96d3cf9a1fc5",
      "text": "嗯，很期待你们有趣的谈话哦～！\n那么，我们马上进入准备阶段吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000067:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0e55c818bd0a2eaf58240100cc84cd24592064ba96b8a322bef162dc240adc2",
      "text": "广播正式录制……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbf4e2c1d36a88e601c568c516153846473accce8440586d631a8490b4e3b127",
      "text": "好的，那么……今天我们邀请到了Jupiter的三位\n作为嘉宾来做客！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce2cad6b806760c0db66387f0647cf1d3697eff7de7f2c6304b85a3f382d3f4f",
      "text": "三位看起来都状态绝佳呢～。前些天的广告\n我也看了哦。大家真是帅得不行啊～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cd898a132e9414d3fa57a12fadcf48f69f9a16e580392d8fd4317abcac9baea",
      "text": "哈哈哈，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b24e5fa21e363ce763f6d15b2b3444316a5449fa24f4054e0a9eda385d4855e6",
      "text": "看来努力上课没有白费呢～！\n冬马君之前可是相当吃力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9ebf0ee586782c636b99676ec8552f1bb39ce2f1b758633f72410d5b1a7c340",
      "text": "最开始明明还说什么“小菜一碟啦”，\n结果一开课整个人就一直绷得死死的呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea757fa89d2cb4ea58afcd7265e23b0a25ec6a054af6265f8e8abe48f000debe",
      "text": "喂、喂！翔太你在得到北斗的建议\n之前，不也一样苦战了半天嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b22b00fad215df5d736ad0bb401c34fdda78f1bf2e1e6e959a12919855aeda6a",
      "text": "接下来是“恋爱烦恼咨询室”环节！\n这次特别由Jupiter来为大家解答！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cc0e0dcf31927fe5d4c59e8e7b2a0b4bf3b15c994fa4ed3695cecdd37b1181f",
      "text": "那么立刻进入来信介绍环节。“不知道怎么跟喜欢的\n女孩子好好搭话，很苦恼”，这位听众是这么说的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de73bbb80f31f9217395ba9b222549adb71b235180014f41e760f2098e7beab0",
      "text": "原来如此啊……唔——\n总之先从打招呼开始试试看怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34cc9f745297823bb08f457a47b828b104dd8ef033f4ac7b1ab72445338516c2",
      "text": "就算只是一句“早上好”，也是巨大的进步了吧。\n越是想着要好好说话，反而越说不出来嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:239077200afaa689ce1c934dfdaa28d30f5875263d1e576ceb903596f75da52f",
      "text": "说得对呢～被人说一句“早上好”，\n其实心里还是蛮高兴的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01aed25b08bd323e62338a42d8079315b335c029671c07155cff1d62127621a1",
      "text": "说不定以此为契机，\n意外地就能聊上天了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14ea5d0b77dcb82ccd04f4b4f2c34b436a43863a04acb50bef427b876eecd343",
      "text": "嗯，我也这么觉得。另外，如果要给建议的话……\n就是别忘了保持笑容，大概是这点吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbe88946bf425737a75452a5f73afbc5ee9acd9460a3cc2d214e19e265f5a4df",
      "text": "因为那会决定对方对你的印象呢。\n脸上常带笑容的人，很让人心动哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b202b71f4332f273eb3f9d711fc69ae3ec70949dacce8a44797bc849d4ec0558",
      "text": "哦哦～虽然广告里的表现也很好，但现实中的\nJupiter更有亲和力，真不错呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_g:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58ee46872bfee21f9cd8e7df95292e2000444eb3fee4704ca25bcf4ade414b5f",
      "text": "打招呼的话门槛也低……\n明天就立刻尝试看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78",
      "text": "休息中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a1bda6ab68d87d749c1d9f2f3f78ec0463d4bab08b984d67125c4f7ba16dc07",
      "text": "聊不习惯的话题，\n真是相当不容易啊。后背都冒汗了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5082a98ca1a814c17f567dedbd4d839748146abdf2ca9fa001ff5332e1eb8d2",
      "text": "会吗？冬马君，发挥得很好呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb291e96feb81fbffe222fbcc84facf8622aff85360a5ca62dcc9034da21778",
      "text": "那是因为北斗巧妙地圆回来了啊。\n谢啦，帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11ed498a5ed6c831e96f15d5337e1135189c630e1d29dfa2a2be830e47d94236",
      "text": "怎么了，北斗君？\n发呆成这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b8956035dc5e1dee56fb9020ff9702ed7910b1e74c55b5b71e8c49676921fb8",
      "text": "嗯，没什么……\n就是下一场录制要回答的这封信啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd41a335e93178d20f75cb46e255b5e769a56379f96aeaae1bc6aef4c0e12267",
      "text": "“失恋了什么事都提不起劲来。\n希望能得到一句让我振作起来的话”吗。这该怎么办才好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c799b86c7d34aeae3fab57c3311d59e893a627cc5faebbeb363cdf2a46edbbfd",
      "text": "怎么说呢，能非常强烈地感受到对方的心情呢。\n感觉这段文字就是她的全部了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29aefdb60e3c0684ceda35f23289ddd5efd48bac6ac3d9add37330d301f2f9c6",
      "text": "嗯。正因为能理解，\n我不知不觉也陷入了沉思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_h:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fef9484509104a2b20ce8f1531668418e20a5562eed3537f175b39371db86e24",
      "text": "虽然很想立刻飞奔到这位天使酱的身边，\n但隔着广播是做不到的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afd02879ca2743ca8b88e1a18ed9743de3cb7006bfee916f9b110a10e5d8eb1c",
      "text": "（北斗这家伙，变了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19c738f4e92e789182b81ddb24d4311b4d1acc6316a302e5b5174a702d10d958",
      "text": "（换作以前的北斗，\n应该送上几句温柔的话就完事了吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2029071095186b06c66c901a5cedfdf604e77cd4ca79d4b9f40711548ba144c7",
      "text": "那么北斗，你有什么想法吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d40fd9a077a3363dbb99f1769debb28443edee824304c8a2c59d6b25371eb9ff",
      "text": "唔——我正在想，既然无法陪伴在身边，\n那该怎么用语言来填补这一空白呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4db6677a3f28c82562809d6b42260d6a46b6edb56932c6d1142b670be4652a5b",
      "text": "作为偶像，送给这位天使酱\n最棒的留言究竟应该是什么样的话语呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb4ef6fb590dfeaa4451df95d6401a08792b30361a3595d59042189281085d87",
      "text": "留言吗……\n这种时候，除了鼓励之外还能怎么办啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68da8b346c8ec42df86e4aac9565e7cc28fc0e362bbb1b349421ed4f395101d7",
      "text": "对粉丝来说，\n我们偶像就是支柱吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188b4eac22b4dfaed6c6a3a17b7ed6dbd08ee4c21e44a2f318e8b11a462f3c0d",
      "text": "寄信来的这个孩子也说了，\n“希望能得到一句让我振作起来的话”不是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdb285b9c56ac8ef3fcf42c95b640e838d5ec893310580bfe8ef3ec760eeda58",
      "text": "所以我觉得，为了能让这孩子打起精神来，\n全力去鼓励她才是最好的办法！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:706ca8e05a935a9320539a42de9ab2f79317b3488cf3a00d2f7d0f3cdb9ac933",
      "text": "哇——冬马君好热血呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5859e0bebedfc27b66c27895a431b1c1e94d5d0a1ca7eeebc7e8474e504bd2a",
      "text": "什……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48e6f3a5696ef0e85f0d9fe3b9c38f03596ac54914059ceaf93e064ce93ed3bd",
      "text": "不过，说不定确实正如冬马君所说的那样哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa8ba2d4281bc07084a0bc8c37d8b7a596d695a6b42b51f03ee8c9cbce8529fa",
      "text": "在失落的时候，直接给予直白的鼓励话语，\n说不定反而是最能让人打起精神来的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:336a6922bd6694a3ea8fcdbbb0ed4494ba4ca0d68556dc635871134ec7710355",
      "text": "鼓励的话语……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab70732d356ff927652c6339fb273b6f237c28672a0c2f63f6e4d4bcc8903725",
      "text": "（这样啊……光是那样就足够了吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_j:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:887c2abd52ab564cde20f91ae79f7332d105159f0e0432b5774cd4745c4de82c",
      "text": "……总之，正式录制的时候我打算放开手脚去鼓励\n她。北斗你也觉得这样行吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7956566b1bc173578390e883a9b5422ec64ae5a7d30c70846037a2a900847a10",
      "text": "嗯，说得也是呢。为了那位天使酱，\n我们就竭尽全力为她送上鼓励的话语吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_j:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74a9a6eb5d238d86113ba2b573ee0d0df08f322958e891280a22ba11220828d4",
      "text": "（换作以前的话，我大概会觉得光靠这样还不充分吧。\n……不过，现在觉得这样就好）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_j:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:710442585b4985f6512a31e7925b7a759f953b45bb0a6ace20ea1230bd35ac9b",
      "text": "（能变得这样去想……\n或许我也在渐渐改变着吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b23f476a2f82daa19abbe63f95ae38c419156fbf032b95faec1e4b32bca5415",
      "text": "然后，是第二期节目的录制……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3372afc518a8830a6c88096f0d1192f21cc5001c68b959a2bead8b13df71bf8",
      "text": "那么，接下来介绍下一封来信。\n“失恋了，什么事都提不起劲来”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b68aa39dda9c98c04b28bf2c8ebc72ee24ad95a1cfb03b664d7ef40923caa0f",
      "text": "“希望能得到一句让我振作起来的话”，她是这么说的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c560e8d5fa5c99faf76344bb49591c42d692bd4afe3df2c9afba757372dd2053",
      "text": "正因为内容简单直白，才更能切实感受到\n前来咨询的天使酱的心情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6741fcc23c668889d1be55cbc8bfaf827d0e1e8c632e45b12abf0b41894cf8c",
      "text": "我想，现在一定满心都是难过的情绪吧。\n但是……未来一定还会迎来新的恋情的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bdfc80c7de07d2771b7eae5203ac1a8a721e3746d337ad42ecf61b5355596bd",
      "text": "在那一天到来之前……我们，\n会一直为了天使酱歌唱下去哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d99401bb806d6404ca7a0f029d68cc23d20fa621f3b6071c014e3122cb399ab",
      "text": "难受的时候，就想想我们吧！\n因为我们无论何时，都会为你加油打气的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db5f2e44f9edbe17db23f063397498e60926bb2bac646ecbbb0ae2d971aadcd1",
      "text": "我们的歌声里，\n蕴含着许许多多送给大家的信息哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba31a49be83f0a294f6c7e710f6e54c1f02fc04034dd4bcf10912c9dbd1b250e",
      "text": "……恋爱，并不全都是快乐的事呢。\n难受痛苦的事，也有很多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6679d2b9178dfe273d6c497b0a2c9569821c78d1a68b36b34d72146732b12945",
      "text": "虽然我们无法实现大家的恋情，\n但是却可以陪伴在你的心灵身旁。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79528cc4cb09a7d1ebc87ac8528dbc65833cc4c1249314d995fceb4d8e9154a7",
      "text": "觉得痛苦的时候，就请想起还有我们在吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44b85f9f736dcae18b2692da4d63e678a35b4ed929728c82276854953e2cae1f",
      "text": "为了能成为大家的力量，\n我们今后也会继续歌唱下去的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79a9448db1fffddce40dc778396f7478cfe306c3b694356ab798727a50c6aade",
      "text": "谢谢你们送上这么棒的寄语！\n那么在咨询环节的最后，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1c894861638f503b6d6820b8bf9dee761ceaab8bbee39e353ef7edaef1ede50",
      "text": "就让我们来听一听Jupiter的歌曲吧。\n这边已经准备好了，北斗君，请报幕吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e657bde3dcf5d34e2d760dfabe045366d540fbe46e45b3908ec8e14e8a216c5",
      "text": "好的。请听我们的歌曲，\n《运命光年》。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000207:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000220:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f68c2df341fbd9941fde30344fa02815ee8bcd046f1703acaa7ac16e1b5d8c8",
      "text": "呐，大家看到粉丝们的\n反应了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000222:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a41c97a20b02c9ddbb3a5dd9a9fe3d31bdfa8f984bbbc83014812e1a065956aa",
      "text": "总觉得，正围绕着一个很有趣的话题\n聊得火热呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000224:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f223d1e45b7835c36dde79a21ecc132d87e553f872e8baa9a6393658f49c0553",
      "text": "…怎么会变成这样啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000226:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04c7ed6c21d0efbec3ea91277156fe6fca0a7d1a597b6a45db6fabf5205c2b8e",
      "text": "天使酱们的心情\n我也能理解哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000228:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d6aa8325f9e35dc6af6be0d250517f4780dc901892c9270b855d1dab93eef29",
      "text": "难道说……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000228:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c13cefb820fe7043a8c6f022952bc61155f370925aac2a91893bcdb8304f652",
      "text": "那个，难道说……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000231:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d719e2717f823e4b3dce546d6ce4cfa787a652f7137894fae2fe71d6fac73dbb",
      "text": "没错！\n就是“想听听我们的初恋小故事”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000233:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74ab88c1f8f8646a34a487d58c530b558208debc30b0793df30bc9c01b4b200b",
      "text": "大家都讨论得\n超级热烈呢～\n真让人伤脑筋啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000235:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f97944687594352cde5c020a80931501e7df05bd31aed1fd1a42a7805ebd574f",
      "text": "冬马君他<emoji>image_talk_emoji_17</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000237:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e663438c269724c3e9af0156273cda1176963290ce7d7da647634e53314a07a0",
      "text": "喂，翔太！\n伤脑筋的只有我一个人吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000239:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d98da57f3e63e2820ad6b89f225903bdbea45d54ce330be0f8b0696969309965",
      "text": "但是，大家能讨论得这么热烈\n还是很让人高兴的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000241:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7c873baa3d41023306e79f2b8f4817eabdaf2bfca47d3fe481d553fac1718d4",
      "text": "什么时候挑个机会聊聊\n那种话题也很不错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
